+/*
+ * fay patch 0017: read-only dump of dart-dcp's APF block (DAPF at 0x28d310000,
+ * from the ADT /defaults pmap-io-ranges; no ADT node declares it) once, at the
+ * first debugfs sweep while the DCP is up. Slices: 0x40 stride.
